{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Return part one is a horror and mystery game that puts you in the role of John, a man who traveled far away in search of a cure. But his recovery journey is turned upside down when he receives a mysterious message from a family member, asking him to return home. Upon his return, he finds the house plunged into darkness, the family disappeared, and an atmosphere saturated with secrets and strange events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will explore room after room in a house filled with family secrets. With each step, John discovers one horrific truth after another, and engages in uncovering mysterious details about what happened to the family, while a terrifying truth about his grandfather begins to emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique horror experience featuring an exciting and complex story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine graphics and details enhance the dark atmosphere of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intertwining puzzles that require exploration skills and concentration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious ending that paves the way for an exciting sequel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to discover the hidden truth? And can you confront the dark secrets that bind the family members?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308540?t=1741764227","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308540?t=1741764227","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308540/885d5480dc2ce37fc38ed4e747e46d31ac526f92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741764227","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308540/885d5480dc2ce37fc38ed4e747e46d31ac526f92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741764227","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","